*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: CMYK
*ContoneOnly: False
*AccurateScreensSupport: True
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*Throughput: "25"
*FileSystem: True
*FreeVM: "32000000"

*Protocols: PJL TBCP
*JCLBegin: "<1B>%-12345X@PJL JOB<0A>"
*JCLToPSInterpreter: "@PJL ENTER LANGUAGE=POSTSCRIPT<0A>"
*JCLEnd: "<1B>%-12345X@PJL EOJ<0A><1B>%-12345X"

*OpenUI *PagePolicy/Page Policy: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *PagePolicy
*DefaultPagePolicy: On
*PagePolicy On/AutoSizeSelect: "<< /DeferredMediaSelection true >> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PagePolicy

*OpenUI *PageSize/Formato pagina: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [595 842] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize A3/A3: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [842 1191] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [421 595] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [612 792] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [595 842] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A3/A3: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [842 1191] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [421 595] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/Letter: "<< /Policies << /PageSize 7 >> /PageSize [612 792] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "12 10 583 832"
*ImageableArea A3/A3: "12 10 830 1181"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "12 10 409 585"
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter: "12 08 600 784"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A3/A3: "842 1191"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "421 595"
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter: "612 792"

*OpenUI *InputSlot/Alimentazione: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: PF730A
*InputSlot PF730A/Cassetto 1: "<< /ManualFeed false >> setpagedevice statusdict begin 0 setpapertray end"
*InputSlot PF730B/Cassetto 2: "<< /ManualFeed false >> setpagedevice statusdict begin 1 setpapertray end"
*InputSlot PF730C/Cassetto 3: "<< /ManualFeed false >> setpagedevice statusdict begin 4 setpapertray end"
*InputSlot PF730D/Cassetto 4: "<< /ManualFeed false >> setpagedevice statusdict begin 5 setpapertray end"
*InputSlot MF1/Vassoio bypass: "<< /ManualFeed false >> setpagedevice statusdict begin 3 setpapertray end"
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*OpenUI *Resolution/Risoluzione: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution [600 600]>> setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200dpi/1200 dpi: "<</HWResolution [1200 1200]>> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Colore: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: CMYK
*ColorModel CMYK/A colori: "<< /ProcessColorModel /DeviceCMYK >> setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/Bianco e Nero: "<< /ProcessColorModel /DeviceGray >> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Duplex/Fronte Retro: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Nessuno: "statusdict begin false setduplexmode false settumble end"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Lato Lungo: "statusdict begin true setduplexmode false settumble end"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Lato Corto: "statusdict begin true setduplexmode true settumble end"
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*OpenUI *Collate/Fascicola: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 19 AnySetup *Collate
*DefaultCollate: True
*Collate True/Attivo: "<</Collate true>> setpagedevice"
*Collate False/Disattivato: "<</Collate false>> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Collate

*OpenUI *KmManagment/Contabilita processi: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 60 AnySetup *KmManagment
*DefaultKmManagment: MG01040
*KmManagment MG01040/Sabina Berselli: "(01040) statusdict /setmanagementnumber get exec"
*KmManagment Default/Disattivato: ""
*CloseUI: *KmManagment

*DefaultFont: Courier
